                                "sense_id": "1a7b0f10-18ae-3eca-946f-582c80dc3071",
                                "text": "The joint was passed around the circle, but he was not a partaker, so he waved it away."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5ba032df-c402-4062-a297-12e7b7033a7a",
                                "sense_id": "1a7b0f10-18ae-3eca-946f-582c80dc3071",
                                "text": "Won with thy words, & conquered with thy lookes,\nI yeeld my ſelfe, my men & horſe to thee:\nTo be partaker of thy good or ill,\nAs long as life maintaines Theridimas."
                            }
                        ]
